[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    41[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | E4 | `mp3d_scale_pcm` (via `synth_pair`, `pcm[16*nch]`) | second accumulator `a <= -32767.5f` | `pcm[16*nch] == -32768` |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    42[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | E5 | `mp3d_scale_pcm` | `a` exactly `== 32766.5f` (boundary is `>=`, inclusive: one step *past* the valid non-clipped range) | `32767` (clipped, **not** `32766`) |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    43[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | E6 | `mp3d_scale_pcm` | `a` exactly `== -32767.5f` (boundary is `<=`, inclusive) | `-32768` (clipped) |
