[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    12[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ```
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    13[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    14[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `synth_pair` is the **only** public entry point — there is no convenience
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m wrapper and no lower-level public function. The lowest-level unit,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `static int16_t mp3d_scale_pcm(float)`, has internal linkage and is therefore
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    17[0m:[38;5;10m[49m reachable only *through* `synth_pair`. Phase B drives it directly anyway, by
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    18[0m:[38;5;10m[49m solving for the `z` tap that makes the accumulator take an exact target value
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m (see `solve_a1` / `solve_a2` in `tests/differential.rs`), so every branch of the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m low-level helper is exercised through the real composed pipeline rather than
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m through a per-wrapper shortcut.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ### Axis 1 — runtime options / modes
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    24[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    25[0m:[38;5;10m[49m There are **no flags, modes, `#ifdef`s or `switch` statements** in the C source
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    26[0m:[38;5;10m[49m (`grep -c 'switch\|#if' c_src/src/lib.c` → 0). The one and only runtime
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    27[0m:[38;5;10m[49m parameter that changes control/data flow is `int nch`, which selects the store
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    28[0m:[38;5;10m[49m offset of the second output sample:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    29[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    30[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ```c
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    31[0m:[38;5;10m[49m pcm[16 * nch] = mp3d_scale_pcm(a);
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    32[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ```
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    33[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
