[38;5;252m[1m## What the library is[0m[0m
[0m[0m
One public function, [38;5;10mvoid synth_pair(int16_t *pcm, int nch, const float *z)[0m — a minimp3 synthesis helper that runs two 8-term single-precision dot products over a 64-float-strided tap array and stores each result through a [38;5;10mstatic[0m saturating scaler. [38;5;10mc_src/src/lib.c[0m is the only translation unit.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;252m[1m## Bugs found (both on error paths, invisible to happy-path tests)[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1m1. [38;5;10m16 * nch[0m was computed in 64-bit instead of wrapping in [38;5;10mint[0m.[22m C's [38;5;10mpcm[16 * nch][0m multiplies two [38;5;10mint[0ms, so the product wraps at 32 bits before sign extension — [38;5;10mnch = INT_MAX[0m stores at [38;5;10mpcm - 16[0m. The Rust did [38;5;10m16isize * nch as isize[0m, offsetting ~34 billion elements and segfaulting. Fixed with [38;5;10m16i32.wrapping_mul(nch) as isize[0m.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1m2. Debug builds aborted instead of segfaulting on a null argument.[22m [38;5;10m*p = v[0m on a raw pointer carries a debug-only null-dereference UB check, so the dev-profile [38;5;10m.so[0m died with [38;5;10mSIGABRT[0m where C died with [38;5;10mSIGSEGV[0m. Switching to [38;5;10mstd::ptr::read[0m/[38;5;10mwrite[0m makes both profiles fault identically.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
