[0m[0m
The [38;5;10mstatic[0m scaler is only reachable through [38;5;10msynth_pair[0m, so the tests invert the accumulation to hit exact accumulator values: with one non-zero tap the accumulator collapses to [38;5;10mfl(v * coef)[0m. A single coefficient only reaches part of the [38;5;10mf32[0m grid — that's why the first solver failed on row E7's [38;5;10m32766.498046875[0m. Searching all 15 block-1 and 8 block-2 coefficients reaches 100% of targets, validated against the C library itself.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;10mmutation_check.sh[0m re-breaks the translation 18 ways; 15 are killed, and the 3 survivors ([38;5;10m>=[0m→[38;5;10m>[0m, [38;5;10m<=[0m→[38;5;10m<[0m, [38;5;10m+.5[0m in [38;5;10mdouble[0m) are proven behaviourally equivalent over all 2^32 [38;5;10mf32[0m inputs by [38;5;10mtests/exhaustive.rs[0m rather than assumed so. Both regression mutants reproducing bug #1 are caught.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
